  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Yangon omflyttningsprogram</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yangon resettlement programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida st&#xf6;djer UNHABITATs projekt &#x201d;Yangon Informal Settlements &#x2013; Resettlement&#x201d;. Insatsen &#xe4;r ett begr&#xe4;nsat st&#xf6;d till en pilotfas.  Projektets m&#xe5;lgrupp &#xe4;r m&#xe4;nniskor som bor i slumomr&#xe5;den i Yangon och syftar till att minimera de risker som en omflyttning av m&#xe4;nniskor inneb&#xe4;r</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida supports UNHABITAT project Yangon Informal Settlements &#x2013; Resettlement. The intervention is a limited pilot support. The project aims to mitigate resettlement risks and increase protection for households relocated/resettled from informal settlements residing in hazardous locations in Yangon.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the project is to mitigate resettlement risks and increase protection for households relocated/ resettled from informal settlements located in hazardous locations in Yangon&apos;s resettlement areas.
Specifically the outcome is expected to be:
- Reduction in resettlement risks and increased protection for participating households
- Relocation/ resettlement is voluntary rather than forced through engagement with households targeted under the programme
- Proper planning of settlements and plan for economic development
- Housing opportunities created for poor and low-income households
- Increased government capacity in resettlement with development planning</narrative>
  </description>
